  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ferme Halal | Poultry Production Extension Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the grant, Ferme Halal seeks to significantly increase its production and sale of eggs, hens, and fertilizer. This project will support the construction of new buildings to raise and house additional laying hens, increase working capital to purchase chicks, feed, veterinary supplies and packaging materials, and obtain technical support to upgrade skills of the staff and management team.</narrative>
  </description>
